+- **F5** `PYTHONPATH=tests/hastub python3 dev/audit/rounds/round10/D14/sweep-N-structure-blind/enumerate.py`,
+  at `554e2ecfa` and at main.
+- **F6** `node tools/policy/field_coverage.mjs --only census`, on the head; then in a
