+    f"{len(_sp_moved)} {_sp_moved[-1]} seen {set(_sp_rounded_seen)}",
+)
+R.check(
+    "an install that can duty-cycle gains none and never scores rounded; a start past "
+    "the last (the warm pass) adds none",
